pty Dumpty\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Kill 50 opponents using the environment (e.g. swamp gas, insects or objects).\",\"name\":\"Environmentally Unfriendly\",\"time\":1434307739},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Perform 10 effective counterattacks in a row without getting hit or parrying.\",\"name\":\"Kaer Morhen Trained\",\"time\":1485369028},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Kill 5 foes in a fight without taking damage (except for Toxicity) and without using the Quen Sign.\",\"name\":\"Can't Touch This!\",\"time\":1433702502},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Ignite the gas produced by a Dragon's Dream bomb using a burning opponent. Do this 10 times.\",\"name\":\"That Is the Evilest Thing\",\"time\":1485412074},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Fill all mutagen slots.\",\"name\":\"Mutant\",\"time\":1488407173},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Kill at least 5 opponents in under 10 seconds.\",\"name\":\"Butcher of Blaviken\",\"time\":1433203954},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"Triple Threat\",\"time\":1432757595},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Defeat Olaf, the Skellige champion of unarmed combat.\",\"name\":\"Brawler\",\"time\":1488236089},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"Make an opponent suffer from bleeding, poisoning and burning simultaneously. Do this 10 times.\",\"name\":\"Overkill\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"Kill 50 human and nonhuman opponents by striking them in the head with a crossbow bolt.\",\"name\":\"Master Marksman\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"What Was That?\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"Kill 2 monsters you have a contract on without using Signs, potions, mutagens, oils or bombs.\",\"name\":\"Even Odds\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Discover 100 fast travel points.\",\"name\":\"Globetrotter\",\"time\":1469143108},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Destroy all monster nests in the Velen / Novigrad region, or in Skellige.\",\