st Control\",\"time\":1487279587},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Acquire all gwent cards available in the base version of the game.\",\"name\":\"Card Collector\",\"time\":1488234357},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Defeat Tybalt and win the gwent tournament held at the Passiflora.\",\"name\":\"Gwent Master\",\"time\":1485369322},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Learn 12 potion formulae.\",\"name\":\"Let's Cook!\",\"time\":1432845977},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Collect the formulae for 6 different bomb types.\",\"name\":\"Bombardier\",\"time\":1433054836},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Read 30 books, journals or other documents.\",\"name\":\"Bookworm\",\"time\":1433808485},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Find and equip all the elements of one set of witcher gear.\",\"name\":\"Armed and Dangerous\",\"time\":1434844720},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Have all possible Place of Power bonuses active at the same time.\",\"name\":\"Power Overwhelming\",\"time\":1790772769},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Complete all fistfighting quests in Velen, Skellige and Novigrad.\",\"name\":\"Brawl Master\",\"time\":1488404813},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Win all the horse races in the game.\",\"name\":\"Fast and Furious\",\"time\":1488235449},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Reach character development level 35.\",\"name\":\"Munchkin\",\"time\":1495836025},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Destroy 10 monster nests using bombs.\",\"name\":\"Fire in the Hole\",\"time\":1434248624},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Defeat an opponent in a fistfight without taking any damage.\",\"name\":\"Fist of the South Star\",\"time\":1434155291},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Win a round of gwent using only neutral cards.\",\"name\":\"Geralt and Friends\",\"time\":1497468421},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Play three hero cards in one round of gwent and win the match.\",\"name\":\"All In\",\"time\":1468555918},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Complete the contract on the shrieker.\",\"name\":\"Shrieker\",\"time\":1433807800},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Complete the contract on Sarasti.\",\"name\":\"Fearless Vampire Slayer\",\"time\":1485901739},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Complete the contract on the Woodland Spirit.\",\"name\":\"Woodland Spirit\",\"time\":1469081040},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Complete the contract on Morvudd.\",\"name\":\"Fiend or Foe?\",\"time\":1488405244},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Complete the contract on Therazane.\",\"name\":\"Ashes to Ashes\",\"time\":1486426273},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Resolve the doppler problem in Novigrad.\",\"name\":\"The Doppler Effect\",\"time\":1468566380},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"I'm Not Kissing That\",\"time\":1496956795},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"Let the Good Times Roll!\",\"time\":1497463499},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"Shopaholic\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"Curator of Nightmares\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"Pacta Sunt Servanda\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"When It's Many Against One…\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"Kill 3 opponents with their own arrows.\",\"name\":\"Return to Sender\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"Be under the influence of seven potions or decoctions at the same time.\",\"name\":\"Can Quit Anytime I Want\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"Wild Rose Dethorned\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"Collect all available Ofieri armor and horse gear, and at least one Ofieri sword.\",\"name\":\"I Wore Ofieri Before It Was Cool\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"Moo-rderer\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"Rad Steez, Bro!\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"Win a round of gwent with a total strength of at least 187.\",\"name\":