ct on the shrieker.\",\"name\":\"Shrieker\",\"time\":1433807800},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Complete the contract on Sarasti.\",\"name\":\"Fearless Vampire Slayer\",\"time\":1485901739},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Complete the contract on the Woodland Spirit.\",\"name\":\"Woodland Spirit\",\"time\":1469081040},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Complete the contract on Morvudd.\",\"name\":\"Fiend or Foe?\",\"time\":1488405244},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Complete the contract on Therazane.\",\"name\":\"Ashes to Ashes\",\"time\":1486426273},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"Resolve the doppler problem in Novigrad.\",\"name\":\"The Doppler Effect\",\"time\":1468566380},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"I'm Not Kissing That\",\"time\":1496956795},{\"achieved\":1,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"Let the Good Times Roll!\",\"time\":1497463499},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"Shopaholic\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"Curator of Nightmares\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"Pacta Sunt Servanda\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"When It's Many Against One…\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"Kill 3 opponents with their own arrows.\",\"name\":\"Return to Sender\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"Be under the influence of seven potions or decoctions at the same time.\",\"name\":\"Can Quit Anytime I Want\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"Wild Rose Dethorned\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"Collect all available Ofieri armor and horse gear, and at least one Ofieri sword.\",\"name\":\"I Wore Ofieri Before It Was Cool\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"Moo-rderer\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"\",\"name\":\"Rad Steez, Bro!\",\"time\":0},{\"achieved\":0,\"description\":\"Win a round of gwent with a total strength of at least 187.\",\"name\":